# Warcode quotes

Cite [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Sec 10. **AGENTS.md wins.**

## Allowed

Under `games/the_warcode/rules/`, `setup/`, and `factions/` only: verbatim quotes from the free public beta PDF in [`raw/the_warcode/`](../../raw/the_warcode/).

Every quote block: **filename + page** (+ section heading). OCR flattened pages: add **via OCR**.

## Hierarchy

- `The Warcode Rulebook V.0.8.7-F.pdf` = baseline.
- Newer free beta on the same topic **supersedes**.
- **Omission is not a patch.**

## Naming safety

**Never** name Kill Team in `games/the_warcode/**`. Use **That other game** or **Murder Platoon**.

## Binary

Beta PDF under `raw/the_warcode/` may be committed (gitignore negation). No STL binaries. `KB/` stays paraphrase.
